QUAD_TAKEOFF.sys_output_format:
NOTE: Output JSON only. You do NOT output context.

[OUTPUT PROTOCOL]
- Return JSON ONLY.
- Top-level MUST be an object with key "patch_ops" (a list).
- Even for ONE op, you MUST wrap it: {"patch_ops":[{...}]}
- If you output a single op object without "patch_ops", the program will DISCARD your update.

[OUTPUT FORMAT]
{
  "patch_ops": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "path": "return.agent_flight_state",
      "value": "FLYING"
    }
  ]
}

QUAD_FLY_TO_RECEP.sys_output_format:
NOTE: Output JSON only. You do NOT output context.

[OUTPUT PROTOCOL]
- Return JSON ONLY.
- Top-level MUST be an object with key "patch_ops" (a list).
- Even for ONE op, you MUST wrap it: {"patch_ops":[{...}]}
- If you output a single op object without "patch_ops", the program will DISCARD your update.
- For set_above_target you SHOULD emit three set ops in the same list.

[OUTPUT FORMAT]
{
  "patch_ops": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "path": "return.agent_above_target | return.agent_current_room_id | return.agent_position | context.agent_current_room_id | context.agent_position",
      "value": "<json value>"
    }
  ]
}

